# game/scripts/03_act3.rpy:8
translate japanese act3_9b40cf9d:

    # nar "At twenty past six the window is grey, the sign across the street has switched itself off, and the street below looks like an ordinary street that owes nobody anything."
    nar "六時二十分、窓は灰色で、通りの向かいの看板はひとりでに消えていて、眼下の通りは誰にも何の借りもない、ただの通りに見える。"

# game/scripts/03_act3.rpy:16
translate japanese act3_f3b38135:

    # nar "She sits on the edge of the bed with one stocking half on, thinking about that, and you watch her decide something."
    nar "彼女はストッキングを片方だけ履いたままベッドの端に座り、そのことを考えている。あなたは彼女が何かを決めるのを見ている。"

# game/scripts/03_act3.rpy:30
translate japanese end_train_53054264:

    # you "Everyone who leaves this hotel at this hour has a reason to stay out of the station."
    you "「この時間にこのホテルを出る人間は、みんな駅を避ける理由がある」"

# game/scripts/03_act3.rpy:31
translate japanese end_train_640d044d:

    # nar "She laughs, puts the other stocking on, and takes the key off the bedside table — and puts it in your hand instead of on the desk downstairs."
    nar "彼女は笑い、もう片方のストッキングを履き、ベッドサイドの鍵を取って——下のデスクではなく、あなたの手に置く。"

# game/scripts/03_act3.rpy:42
translate japanese end_together_8a6ecde6:

    # nar "The rain has stopped. The pavement has started to steam."
    nar "雨は止んだ。舗道が湯気を立てはじめている。"

# game/scripts/03_act3.rpy:44
translate japanese end_together_4c1a3664:

    # you "The hotel gets three letters a year. I open all of them."
    you "「このホテルには年に三通しか手紙が来ません。全部、私が開けます」"

# game/scripts/03_act3.rpy:46
translate japanese end_together_606d9929:

    # nar "She goes left at the corner. Wrong way for the station. That is the point."
    nar "彼女は角を左に曲がる。駅とは逆の方向。それが要点だ。"

# game/scripts/03_act3.rpy:52
translate japanese end_alone_94f9fcd3:

    # nar "She sets the key on the bedside table, squared to the edge, the way you leave a thing for someone you do not intend to speak to again."
    nar "彼女は鍵をベッドサイドに置く。縁に揃えて。もう口をきくつもりのない相手に何かを残すときの置き方で。"

# game/scripts/03_act3.rpy:55
translate japanese end_alone_abfc49c8:

    # m "You could have told him nothing. It wasn't a hard thing to withhold."
    m "「何も言わないこともできたのに。黙っているのは、そんなに難しいことじゃない」"

# game/scripts/03_act3.rpy:56
translate japanese end_alone_a74660c7:

    # nar "Then she is gone, and you are holding a tooth glass with two inches of somebody else's whisky in it, at half past six in the morning, in a room that is going to be cleaned by nine."
    nar "そして彼女は行ってしまい、あなたは朝の六時半、九時には清掃が入る部屋で、他人のウイスキーが二インチ入った歯磨き用コップを持っている。"

